Subject: [PATCH] Experimental VA session, allocation and writer observer

Replaces the initial observer experiment by z23; original contributions remain
in companion PR100 history. Maintainer implementation and adversarial tests are
AI-assisted. GPL-3.0-or-later, like the pinned driver. Metadata only; no mapping
or coherence admission. See CONTRACT.md for the supported ownership boundary.

